From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sidharthify <wednisegit@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:09:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] status: Add flashlight quick toggle

Phones usually have a flash LED that the kernel exposes as a LED class
device named <color>:flash or <color>:torch. Add a quick settings toggle
for the first such LED, which sets it to full torch brightness through
logind's Session.SetBrightness, so no extra permissions are needed. The
toggle is only added when a flash LED exists.

Signed-off-by: sidharthify <wednisegit@gmail.com>
